<h1>Build the tree</h1>
<p>Run this:</p>
<pre class="md-code"><code><span class="tok-variable tok-function">make</span> check</code></pre>
<p>The loop, as a sketch:</p>
<pre class="md-code"><code><span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">/*</span><span class="tok-comment tok-block"> not the code of the repository </span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">*/</span>
<span class="tok-storage tok-type">int</span> <span class="tok-entity tok-name">main</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">(</span><span class="tok-storage tok-type">void</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">)</span> <span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">{</span>
    <span class="tok-keyword tok-control">return</span> <span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">&quot;</span><span class="tok-string tok-quoted">hi</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">&quot;</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">[</span><span class="tok-constant tok-numeric">0</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">]</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-terminator">;</span>
<span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">}</span></code></pre>
<pre class="md-code"><code><span class="tok-storage tok-type">fn</span> <span class="tok-entity tok-name">main</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">()</span> <span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">{</span> <span class="tok-support tok-macro">println!</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">(</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">&quot;</span><span class="tok-string tok-quoted">&lt;b&gt;</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-definition">&quot;</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">)</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-terminator">;</span> <span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">}</span></code></pre>
